---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Condition Monitoring & Predictive Maintenance | Machine Reliability Services"
  description="Maximize equipment uptime, prevent unexpected breakdowns, and reduce operational costs with our advanced condition monitoring, vibration analysis, and laser shaft alignment services."
>
  <div style="background-color: #222222; color: #FFFFFF; min-height: 100vh;">

    <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (Starts 60px down from header) -->
    <section style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 48px;">
      <div style="max-width: 1152px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px;">
        
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 48px; align-items: start;">
          
          <!-- Left Column (H1 Content: 60px left padding) -->
          <div style="padding-left: 60px;">
            <span style="color: #9CA3AF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              Predictive Maintenance & Reliability
            </span>
            
            <!-- H1 Header: White -->
            <h1 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              Condition Monitoring Services
            </h1>
            
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.625;">
              Transition from costly reactive firefighting to proactive machinery healthcare. Our condition monitoring services provide real-time insights into machine health—stopping catastrophic failures before they happen.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Schedule Button: 30px below paragraph -->
            <a href="#contact" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; background-color: #FF7F00; color: #222222; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
              Schedule an Inspection
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Right Column (Image with 2px Orange Border) -->
          <div style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #FF7F00; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);">
            <img 
              src="/cs-condition-monitoring-shaft-alignment.avif" 
              alt="Laser shaft alignment system on industrial machinery" 
              style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; object-fit: cover;"
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. OVERVIEW SECTION (40px below image, Center Aligned, H2 in Orange) -->
    <section style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 896px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
        <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
          What is Condition Monitoring?
        </h2>
        <div style="width: 80px; height: 4px; background-color: #FF7F00; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border-radius: 2px; margin-bottom: 32px;"></div>
        
        <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.625; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: center; max-width: 768px;">
          <strong style="color: #FFFFFF;">Condition Monitoring (CM)</strong> is the continuous or periodic measurement of physical parameters—such as vibration, temperature, oil purity, and thermal profiles—in operating machinery. By tracking changes in these indicators over time, we can detect early-stage mechanical degradation long before functional failure occurs.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; border-top: 4px solid #FF7F00; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; max-width: 768px;">
          <!-- H3 Header: White -->
          <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center;">
            How We Elevate Your Maintenance Strategy
          </h3>
          <p style="color: #D1D5DB; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
            Unplanned downtime drains capital, interrupts production, and leads to expensive secondary damage. We go beyond simply generating data logs—our certified reliability engineers deliver <strong>clear, actionable diagnosis</strong> and targeted recommendations. We help you extend machinery lifespan, optimize lube cycles, lower energy consumption, and plan maintenance during scheduled outages on <em>your</em> terms.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. SOLUTIONS GRID SECTION (Center Aligned, H2 in Orange, H3 in White) -->
    <section style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 1152px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
          <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
          <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
            Our Condition Monitoring Solutions
          </h2>
          <p style="color: #D1D5DB; max-width: 672px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;">
            We combine advanced Non-Destructive Testing (NDT) technologies with deep engineering expertise to safeguard critical plant assets.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; width: 100%;">
          
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Condition Monitoring Programs</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Turnkey predictive maintenance management tailored to your plant criticality matrix. We set baseline parameters, perform regular route inspections, analyze trending data, and provide easy-to-read executive summary reports with clear repair priorities.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Vibration Analysis</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Vibration is the heart rate of rotating equipment. Using FFT spectrum analysis, peakVue technology, and phase measurements, we pinpoint unbalance, misalignment, roller bearing defects, gear tooth wear, structural looseness, and resonance early.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Precision Shaft Alignment</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Misalignment accounts for up to 50% of rotating machinery breakdowns. Utilizing state-of-the-art laser alignment tools, we restore horizontal, vertical, and angular alignment within OEM tolerances—reducing seal strain, power consumption, and bearing stress.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              04
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Oil & Fluid Analysis</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Oil is the liquid blood of your machine. Our laboratory fluid analysis tests for wear metals, particle counts, water contamination, viscosity index, and additive depletion—letting you assess component health and safely extend oil drain intervals.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 5 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              05
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Infrared Thermography</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Non-contact thermal imaging detects invisible electrical phase imbalances, loose connections, overloaded circuits, friction hotspots, and refractory insulation leaks—preventing electrical fires and component burnouts.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 6 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              06
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Machinery Lubrication</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Improper lubrication causes over 70% of premature bearing failures. We design and audit best-in-class lubrication programs: establishing correct lubricant selection, precise regreasing volumes/frequencies, contamination control, and storage solutions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 7 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              07
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center;">Root Cause Failure Analysis (RCFA)</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; max-width: 768px; margin: 0;">
              When a component fails, repairing it without identifying the underlying cause invites repeat failures. Our forensic engineering team conducts thorough Root Cause Failure Analysis—evaluating fractography, operational history, lubrication quality, and alignment logs to implement permanent corrective measures.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. BOTTOM CTA SECTION (Centered, H2 in Orange, Button 30px below paragraph) -->
    <section id="contact" style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 896px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
        <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
          Ready to Eliminate Unplanned Downtime?
        </h2>
        <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; text-align: center; max-width: 672px; margin: 0;">
          Partner with our reliability specialists to implement a condition monitoring schedule customized to your plant's operational demands.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Get in Touch Button: 30px below paragraph -->
        <a href="/contact" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; background-color: #FF7F00; color: #222222; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
          Get in Touch With Us
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>